WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.869
This example creates a small table with several
constraints Email

00:00:05.882 --> 00:00:13.159
is required The email must match a teaching-level
shape check Phone

00:00:13.185 --> 00:00:18.697
is either NULL or exactly ten digits Email is also
unique

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:26.245
Run the valid insert first Then try changing a value
to violate

00:00:26.271 --> 00:00:28.942
one rule and observe PostgreSQL reject it
